  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat a non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "2. Add the chickpeas to the pan and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "3. Add the hummus to the pan and stir to combine with the chickpeas.",
    "4. Warm the wrap in the microwave for 10-15 seconds.",
    "5. Assemble the wrap by spreading the chickpea-hummus mixture on the wrap.",
    "6. Add the mixed greens, cucumber, tomato, and pita chips on top.",
    "7. If using, sprinkle feta cheese and drizzle tzatziki sauce on top.",
    "8. Fold the wrap in half to enclose the filling.",
    "9. Serve immediately and enjoy!"
